    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`nemsServer` is the local messaging server module for the `startio` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for local EMS/NEMS server activation and runtime topology. Messaging behavior and provider adapters belong in the messaging modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Local messaging settings should preserve provider governance, diagnostics, and layered overrides."
    }
